Probably onFocus calls datepicker.show(). And onBlur? Not registered. Instead they rely on clicking outside (mousedown on document) to hide via onClickOutside. That would hide when user clicks elsewhere, but not when tabbing away (which triggers focus change without a mousedown). So the datepicker remains open when tabbing away because no blur handler to hide.

